     sseettffmmaacc — set MAC label for a file system object

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     sseettffmmaacc [--hhqqRR] _l_a_b_e_l _f_i_l_e _._._.

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The sseettffmmaacc utility assigns the specified MAC label to the specified
     files.  The following options are available:

     --RR      Set the labels on the file hierarchies rooted in the files in‐
             stead of just the files themselves.

     --hh      If the file is a symbolic link, change the label of the link
             rather than the file that the link points to.

     --qq      Do not print non-fatal warnings during execution.

